<title>HONG KONG: Samsung Life buys stake in Equinox.</title>
<headline>Samsung Life buys stake in Equinox.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Direct investment firm Equinox Group said on Monday that South Korea's Samsung Life Insurance has bought an equity stake in the firm for US$25 million.</p>
<p>Other shareholders in Equinox are Aboitiz Group of the Philippines, Hong Kong-based Asia Financial Group, BHF-BANK of Germany, Taiwan's China Development Corp, Credit Commercial de France, Japan's Itochu Capital and Investment (Asia) Ltd and the PSP Group of Indonesia.</p>
<p>Equinox did not give other details.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
